    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Duns">Duns</ref> 3.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">XII lahmen scylon riht tæcean Wealan ⁊ Ænglan: VI Englisce ⁊ VI Wylisce.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Twelve lahmen must administer justice [between] the Welsh and English [of the Dunsæte district]: six Englishmen and six Welshmen.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Duodecim lahmen (id est legis homines) debent rectum discernere Walis et Anglis: sex Walisci et sex Anglici.</ab>
      </div>
